@startuml
title Chrome 插件 · DevTools 请求列表过滤与排序

rectangle "DevTools 单请求 Tab" {
  (HAR/SW 缓冲 recentRequests) as CAP
  (搜索 + 方法 + 状态 + 类型芯片) as FILTER
  (列头排序) as SORT
  (点选填任务描述) as PICK
  CAP --> FILTER
  FILTER --> SORT
  SORT --> PICK
}

note right of SORT
  测试：taskChromePlugin/test/request-list-query.test.js
  测试：taskChromePlugin/test/user-guide.test.js
  意图：frontend/task_chrome_plugin_devtools_request_filter_sort
  测试点：T1-T14
end note
@enduml
